<title>FINLAND: FINNISH OCT JOBLESS DATA DUE NOV 14 0830 - MINISTRY.</title>
<headline>FINNISH OCT JOBLESS DATA DUE NOV 14 0830 - MINISTRY.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Labour Ministry's October employment report will be released on Thursday November 14 at 0830, the ministry said in a statement on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>The mean of six analysts forecasts for the October unemployment rate calculated by the ministry is 17.1 percent in a 17.0-17.3 percent range.</p>
<p>In September, the jobless rate was 16.7 percent, according to the ministry.</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
</text>
